  "content": "<h2>NoCapes</h2><p>Условно отключает отображение любых и всех майнкрафтовских плащей и пользовательских элитр.</p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminalMC/NoCapes/HEAD/assets/images/config_01.png\" style=\"width:80%\"><h3>Зависимости</h3><p>Fabric: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fP7dR8mSH\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p><p>NeoForge: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p><h3>Контакты</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&amp;label=Discord Server&amp;color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord Server\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/NoCapes/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/NoCapes?logo=github&amp;label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub Issues\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/NoCapes/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/TerminalMC/NoCapes?label=License&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>",
